      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkiteng'enat oo loo nkakuyiaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eiturrurrokino Ilfarisayo enetii Yesu, eboitare ninche ematua oo lasirak, ooetuo eing'uaa Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedol aajo keinos kulikae ooiteng'eni lenyena endaa eiduruk inkaik, eji meisuja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Amu ore Lfarisayo, naa neijia etiu Ilyahudi pooki, menya endaa eitu eisuj inkaik enye, pee eitabaya nkoon oo lpayiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa te nepuonu eing'uaa ineemirishoreki; menya endaa eitu eng'as aaisuj ate. Naa keeta kulie koon naaitabaya ninche, anaa enkisujata oo nkikompeni o motioo o ntokitin oo suyan.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuan Ilfarisayo o lasirak aajoki, “Ainyoo pee mesuj ilooiteng'eni linono nkoon oo lpayiani metaa kenya endaa too nkaik naaiduruk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 29.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki ninye ninche, “Esipa enotoko Isaya pee eibonisho ajo ti alo intae isunkuro, anaa enaigero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ninche, “Inotito intae olosek lianyienyie nkitanapat e Nkai, pee itumutumu aaitabai nkoon inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 20.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 20.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 5.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu etejo, Musa ‘Iyanyita minyi o ng'utunyi,’ nejo sii, ‘Ore olomor menye anaa ng'otonye, neiririkino keeya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake nijojo intae, ‘Te nejoki oltung'ani menye aashu ng'otonye, Ore entoki duoo nikitumie nanu etaa korban (aa taa enaishori Enkai) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimintokiki aaisho ilo meitaasa menye anaa ng'otonye toki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te ina nintaa pesho ororei le Nkai te nena koon inyi nintarasakinono. Niasiasa doi kulie kumok neeijo nena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki aipotu olorere nejoki, “Entoning'oki intae pooki, naa enchoo ejing'aa intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae entoki e oriong oltung'ani naa te nejing ade atua neidim aisarkionie ninye; kake mbaa naapuku ti atua oltung'ani naaitaa ninye torrono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te neeta oltung'ani nkiyiaa naaning'ishore toning'o.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ejing aji, neing'uaa olorere, neikilikuan ilooiteng'eni lenyena enajo ina kitanyaanyukoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche, “Aimejing'aa sii ninche intae? Aimidolidolo aajo ore pooki toki natii oriong oltung'ani, te nejing nemeidim aitarruoi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu te nejing, mme oltau lenye ejing kake enkoshoke, neipung ade ake?” (Ore pee ejo neijia neitisiny indaiki pooki.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo, “Ore inaapuku ti atua oltung'ani, ninche naaitarruoo oltung'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu atua oltung'ani eing'uaa indamunot torrok, enkiborra oo nkonyek, empurrorre, earata metua, eloloito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'uarrat torrok, enkarrueisho, olosek torrono, enkipororonkos, olom, esulare, olwuasa, emodai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atua oltung'ani eing'uaa kuna torrok pooki, naa kuna naaisarkionie oltung'ani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkirukoto e nkitok o losho le Sirofoinike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee epuku te ine nelo olkirine le Turo o Sidon. Nejing enkaji nabo, nemeyieu neyiolouni aajo etii ine; kake etalaikinoteki aaisudoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore nabo kata netii enkitok, naibung'a entito enye kiti oloirirua oiduruk, nening ajo etii ine, nelotu, nebatata too nkejek enyena aserem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina kitok naa enoo Lyunani, o losho le Sirofoinike te inoto. Neomon metaarai oloirirua te ina tito enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ina kitok, “Inchoo eng'asi aaitoti nkera, amu meishiaakino teneyae mukateni oo nkera aanang'aki ldiein.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etawalikia ninye nejoki, “Ee itisipa lo kitok; kake ore sii ninche ndiein naalutoo emisa nesotu rrarrat ooitadoyio nkera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye, “Ore te nkaraki ina nitejo, shomo ang; etung'uayie oloirirua entito ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo ang, neinepu enkerai eirrag te rruat, neshomo oloirirua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerrinyunye Yesu aing'uaa ilo kirine le Turo, neimaa Sidon alo enkalo e naiposha e Galilaya, nepolos aimaa atua Dekapoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerikokini oltung'ani ming'ani laa penyo sii neiro, nesai meiteleiki enkaina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerik aitung'uaa atua olorere arik aa ninye ake openy, nepik ilkimojik nkiyiaa enyena, nenotu nkamulak neiseyie olng'ejep lenye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neing'or shumata, neitadoiyie oltau, nejoki ninye, “Efafata,” nchere, “Taboloyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebolo nkiyiaa enyena, nelaa eneta o lng'ejep lenye, neiro aitobiraki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitanap pee meliki likae tung'ani; kake ore anaa pee eitanap ajoki melikioo, neitulus ninye eitadaraa ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelus enking'asia enye neaku keji, “Etaasa mbaa pooki aitobiraki ore ninye ilming'anta o lemeiro, neidimie aisho meiroro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
